# Scene1-1-b1

; ========================================
; ●シーン1-1‐b1
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1

[PrintTextModified Text:试图保护蕾雅。|#0101Bad01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.8 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.4 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3,ArmL7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛站到了看守和蕾雅中间。|#0101Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛！？|#0101Bad01_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1 SubId:Middle
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Jailer-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:15 ScenePositionY:8 Scale:1.4

[PrintTextModified Text:看守的镰刀向艾玛挥下——|#0101Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ざんっと肉が切れる音
@HidePrinter
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_12 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#ff0000 Duration:0.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@HideActors ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的身体被劈开左右两半，瘫倒在地上。|#0101Bad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_20_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:悲剧突然再次降临，<br>在场的各位少女脸上都写满了恐惧。|#0101Bad01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他人连惨叫都喊不出声，而蕾雅也丧失了对看守的反抗之心。|#0101Bad01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么会想着保护我……<br>那一下我明明是可以躲开的……|#0101Bad01_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～……又死人了？<br>明明才刚死了一个……|#0101Bad01_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:唉～～……又多了好多无谓的工作……<br>求大家行行好，真的不要再反抗啦。|#0101Bad01_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长摆出一副嫌麻烦的样子，叹了一口气。|#0101Bad01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Jailer
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Jailer Loop:false ScenePositionX:30|50|70 Duration:2|2|2

[PrintTextModified Text:看守正在收拾希罗和艾玛的尸体，<br>在场的少女们仍呆站着一动不动。|#0101Bad01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:有人面露悔恨，似乎自知前路不再通向希望；<br>有人心惊胆战，似乎自己正走在一条昏暗的隧道当中——|#0101Bad01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而隧道的前方，绝无一丝光明。<br>只有绝望在前方招手。|#0101Bad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很遗憾，一切都结束了。|#0101Bad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

